    "context": "[para-541] Informal pre-disciplinary discussion\n\n[para-542] Where appropriate, prior to using the formal aspects of the Company’s disciplinary procedure, a pre-disciplinary discussion will be held with the employee.\n\n[para-544] Minor misconduct, poor performance or minor breaches of rules will normally result an in informal warning being given by the immediate manager. This will not be recorded in writing. If that approach is not successful, the Company is likely to escalate it to the formal disciplinary procedure.\n\n[para-547] The disciplinary procedure\n\n[para-548] This procedure will be used in cases of a breach of the rules or poor performance that have not been remedied by an informal warning.  Normally, the procedure will follow the steps listed below, although it is acceptable to move directly to steps two or three if a case is sufficiently serious.",
