    "sectionId": "para-1436",
    "filename": "Rockwater Group Employee Handbook (April 2026).docx",
    "context": "[para-1433] Stock and Cash Responsibility\n\n[para-1434] It is your responsibility to accurately account for all items purchased and sold and paid to Rockwater. all monies you receive from all transactions carried out both inside and outside the Rockwater premises. You are not permitted to borrow money from Rockwater. or to use the Company’s money for any unauthorised purpose. Any authorised expenditure must be fully documented.\n\n[para-1436] You are responsible for completing all end of day reporting, for the safe keeping of the Company’s monies and stock and the securing of the Company’s premises in accordance with the training you receive relating to cash and stock handling and security of the building.\n\n[para-1438] Offering Complimentary Drinks, Food and Services\n\n[para-1439] Complimentary drinks and food may be offered by senior managers and directors in order to promote the business. No other member of the team is authorised to offer complimentary drinks, food or services.",
