    "context": "[PDF page 4; public edition with explicit redactions]\n\nREFERENCES\nYour employment is subject to the receipt of satisfactory references covering the past two\nyears of employment, including one from your last employer and/or from your place of\neducation. It is the final decision of Rockwater determine if such references meet with our\nrequirements.\nRIGHT TO WORK\nYou must provide us with proof you can work in the UK, in accordance with the conditions\nlaid down in the Immigration, Asylum and Nationality Act 2006, as amended.\nAPPLICATION FORM\nIt is a condition of your employment that the information given, and statements made at your\ninterview and on your application form or Curriculum Vitae, are true and complete in every\nrespect.\nPENSION\nIn accordance with our Employer duties under pensions automatic enrolment legislation after\nthree months’ service, subject to eligibility employees will be automatically opted into a\nqualifying scheme. If this applies to you, you will receive further details separately, together\nwith information as to any contributions that you or we may be required to make.\nThe current Scheme is NEST. The Employer Pension Scheme Reference number is\n[SCHEME REFERENCE REDACTED].\nAfter three months’ service and if you do not qualify to be automatically opted into the\ncurrent Scheme you may be eligible to voluntarily opt into the scheme. Details are available\nfrom HR Department.\nBENEFITS\nThe following benefits are non-contractual and maybe withdrawn or changed without notice\nand without breaching the contract of employment:\n· 25% Discount on food for you and up to three guests when you dine with us.\n· A complimentary staff meal during your shift when you are on duty.\n· Complimentary, tea, coffee and soft drinks when you are working on shift.\n· At the discretion of the duty manager a glass of house wine or beer directly after the\nend of your working shift.\n· Wellbeing Services Programme, including a 24/7 emergency telephone support.\nTRAINING AND DEVELOPMENT\n4",
